1
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:20,580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

2
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:28,340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

3
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

4
00:00:46,940 --> 00:00:50,810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

5
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

6
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:58,720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

7
00:01:36,380 --> 00:01:37,620
[Pull Strings]

8
00:01:37,620 --> 00:01:39,380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

9
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:40,930
If Changgeng

10
00:01:41,040 --> 00:01:42,740
could see your change today,

11
00:01:43,430 --> 00:01:44,900
he'd be so happy for you.

12
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:53,410
Come to think of it,

13
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,100
I must thank you for this armor.

14
00:01:56,710 --> 00:01:57,490
What?

15
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:58,490
Well.

16
00:01:59,710 --> 00:02:01,330
You gave this armor to me.

17
00:02:02,400 --> 00:02:03,260
I did?

18
00:02:03,680 --> 00:02:05,100
The other day,
when the maids brought clothes,

19
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,770
there was armor hidden inside by magic.

20
00:02:07,430 --> 00:02:09,570
The maids, low in power, didn't notice.

21
00:02:09,870 --> 00:02:10,850
They thought it was just
an ordinary garment

22
00:02:10,870 --> 00:02:11,730
and gave it to me.

23
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:15,610
I gave it to you?

24
00:02:15,630 --> 00:02:17,290
As a human disciple,

25
00:02:17,590 --> 00:02:19,100
you're truly thoughtful.

26
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,780
Thanks to your war armor.

27
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,890
Otherwise, the Little Prince
would've been hurt.

28
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:24,500
This armor is a real treasure,

29
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,690
impervious to blades and spears.

30
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,940
You kept this fine thing hidden.

31
00:02:27,190 --> 00:02:27,980
So composed.

32
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,380
Back then, Your Highness,

33
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:31,100
when the giant dragon pinned you down,

34
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:32,690
it was also this human disciple

35
00:02:32,710 --> 00:02:34,100
who told me to shout to you

36
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:35,500
that you should transform into a dragon.

37
00:02:36,310 --> 00:02:37,690
I did that?

38
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:39,290
What reached my ears

39
00:02:39,310 --> 00:02:40,890
was your voice.

40
00:02:41,080 --> 00:02:42,010
The formation is complete.

41
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,500
Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

42
00:02:44,120 --> 00:02:44,890
What should I say?

43
00:02:44,910 --> 00:02:46,610
Repeat what I say.

44
00:02:46,630 --> 00:02:47,940
Repeat after me, loudly.

45
00:02:49,280 --> 00:02:50,060
Your Highness,

46
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,890
Ao Jia faces you in dragon form,

47
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:53,500
already forsaking all brotherly ties.

48
00:02:53,710 --> 00:02:54,690
He treats you this way,

49
00:02:54,710 --> 00:02:56,660
so why go easy on him?

50
00:02:57,910 --> 00:03:00,220
You could actually

51
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:00,980
pull off an advanced spell

52
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,010
like Voice Transmission.

53
00:03:03,080 --> 00:03:04,690
The Human Clan's strength
can't be underestimated.

54
00:03:04,710 --> 00:03:05,500
No, no.

55
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:07,010
Well.

56
00:03:07,590 --> 00:03:09,500
I've got something to take care of.

57
00:03:09,520 --> 00:03:10,340
You two,

58
00:03:11,710 --> 00:03:12,850
stick to the plan.

59
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:17,850
What's wrong with him?

60
00:03:19,190 --> 00:03:20,130
This is just how he is.

61
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,290
What he loves most is
giving others credit.

62
00:03:22,310 --> 00:03:24,410
What he hates most is being praised.

63
00:03:24,800 --> 00:03:25,570
Junior.

64
00:03:26,910 --> 00:03:27,690
Junior.

65
00:03:28,710 --> 00:03:29,260
Senior...

66
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:29,980
Senior.

67
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:31,570
What about the Second Prince?

68
00:03:31,590 --> 00:03:32,060
Today, I...

69
00:03:32,080 --> 00:03:33,660
I told you to distract everyone.

70
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:34,610
What did you do?

71
00:03:34,910 --> 00:03:35,660
I...

72
00:03:35,680 --> 00:03:37,100
What exactly did you do?

73
00:03:37,520 --> 00:03:38,690
I just walked over there

74
00:03:38,710 --> 00:03:40,290
and waved at that paper puppet,

75
00:03:40,310 --> 00:03:41,500
and the next second, it exploded.

76
00:03:41,520 --> 00:03:42,540
I didn't do a thing.

77
00:03:43,430 --> 00:03:44,450
Exploding paper puppets.

78
00:03:46,400 --> 00:03:47,660
Those are all my tricks.

79
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:50,690
Who knows me this well,

80
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:52,940
acting on my exact plans beforehand?

81
00:03:53,870 --> 00:03:55,500
It's like a heart-to-heart connection.

82
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,890
A heart-to-heart connection.

83
00:04:01,800 --> 00:04:03,610
This armor protects against any blade.

84
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:05,220
It's a rare treasure indeed.

85
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,220
Didn't Fairy Yunxiao come by once?

86
00:04:07,240 --> 00:04:08,690
The Court's weapons
and magic instruments

87
00:04:08,710 --> 00:04:09,850
were all taken.

88
00:04:09,910 --> 00:04:11,980
You could actually

89
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:12,850
pull off an advanced spell

90
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:14,500
like Voice Transmission.

91
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:17,020
The formation is complete.
Tell the Little Prince to transform now.

92
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,900
I see.

93
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:28,410
It's a heart-to-heart connection.

94
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:29,700
Junior,

95
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:31,290
we share a heart-to-heart connection!

96
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,140
A heart-to-heart connection.

97
00:04:35,480 --> 00:04:36,610
A heart-to-heart connection?

98
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:40,290
We share a heart-to-heart connection?

99
00:04:41,920 --> 00:04:43,050
I don't feel it.

100
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,050
Is he talking about him and me?

101
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:48,820
[Episode 24]

102
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:12,460
Watch closely.

103
00:05:12,800 --> 00:05:13,580
Yes.

104
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:20,410
The Sword fragment surfaced.

105
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,100
Ao Yi will soon seize power.

106
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,930
Westdawn Sect will surely lose patience.

107
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,490
Within three days,

108
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:27,100
they'll come for the Sword.

109
00:05:27,270 --> 00:05:28,900
Be ready to fight at any moment.

110
00:05:30,120 --> 00:05:31,290
Changshou, rest assured.

111
00:05:31,920 --> 00:05:33,340
I've cultivated for a millennium,

112
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,730
yet my magic only served
to arrange marriages.

113
00:05:35,920 --> 00:05:38,490
Today, I can finally act
like a real man

114
00:05:38,510 --> 00:05:39,370
and have a real fight.

115
00:05:39,390 --> 00:05:40,730
When I give the order,

116
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:42,290
you open the scroll.

117
00:05:42,310 --> 00:05:43,020
Don't worry.

118
00:05:43,040 --> 00:05:43,900
Just go for it.

119
00:05:45,120 --> 00:05:46,290
Open it; don't aim at me.

120
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:46,900
Aim it outside.

121
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:47,580
You go ahead.

122
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:49,100
I didn't tell you to open it now.

123
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:49,490
All right.

124
00:05:50,120 --> 00:05:51,580
Stay calm. Stay calm.

125
00:05:52,510 --> 00:05:54,460
I'm calm. I'm calm.

126
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,610
I'm calm.

127
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:59,340
I'll remind you once more.

128
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:03,020
One move makes or breaks it.

129
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:05,290
The day Westdawn Sect moves,

130
00:06:05,310 --> 00:06:08,020
the Dragon Palace bows
to the Celestial Court,

131
00:06:09,070 --> 00:06:11,290
and that's when I rise.

132
00:06:19,190 --> 00:06:20,140
What's wrong, Changshou?

133
00:06:20,310 --> 00:06:21,810
A powerful surge of spiritual power

134
00:06:22,870 --> 00:06:24,340
is attacking my paper butterflies.

135
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:26,540
Then are your butterflies all right?

136
00:07:37,430 --> 00:07:38,490
A thousand years ago,

137
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:41,730
the Celestial Court
left the Sea-Calming Pillar

138
00:07:41,750 --> 00:07:43,700
but took away the Primordial Sword.

139
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,900
The message is this:

140
00:07:46,430 --> 00:07:49,850
If the Dragon Palace
of the East Sea ever disobeys,

141
00:07:49,870 --> 00:07:51,660
they can open the Eye of the Sea

142
00:07:51,830 --> 00:07:53,050
and doom the East Sea at any time.

143
00:07:53,390 --> 00:07:54,410
But what happened today?

144
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,100
The Celestial Court gave me
a fragment of the Primordial Sword.

145
00:07:58,480 --> 00:08:02,050
It shows unmatched trust and sincerity.

146
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:04,850
They believe that with me here,

147
00:08:05,270 --> 00:08:06,850
the Eye of the Sea will be safe.

148
00:08:07,310 --> 00:08:12,250
If I refuse,
you can't take the fragment.

149
00:08:14,190 --> 00:08:17,050
Your Majesty, you knew I would come.

150
00:08:17,430 --> 00:08:19,410
You secretly urged my son, Ao Jia,

151
00:08:19,430 --> 00:08:20,810
to claim the East Sea throne.

152
00:08:20,830 --> 00:08:24,100
Then you lured Fairy Yunxiao here
to seize the Sea-Calming Pillar.

153
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:26,290
Did you think your deeds in the East Sea

154
00:08:26,310 --> 00:08:27,700
would escape my notice?

155
00:08:29,390 --> 00:08:30,900
You noticed long ago.

156
00:08:31,800 --> 00:08:33,700
So, for years, you feigned madness

157
00:08:34,510 --> 00:08:36,010
to keep the First Prince
from the throne.

158
00:08:36,480 --> 00:08:39,820
You also led Fairy Yunxiao
to Bear Island

159
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,010
to protect the Sea-Calming Pillar.

160
00:08:43,440 --> 00:08:45,940
I've been the Dragon King
for a thousand years.

161
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,730
Your petty tricks

162
00:08:48,790 --> 00:08:49,700
are nothing to me.

163
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:51,100
Your Majesty,

164
00:08:51,870 --> 00:08:52,850
you won't kill me?

165
00:08:53,480 --> 00:08:54,890
If I meant to kill you,

166
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,940
that strike just now

167
00:08:57,510 --> 00:08:59,250
would have left you doomed.

168
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,420
You won't kill me

169
00:09:04,840 --> 00:09:05,820
only because you

170
00:09:07,630 --> 00:09:08,770
need me.

171
00:09:10,670 --> 00:09:12,650
What could I need from you?

172
00:09:13,480 --> 00:09:14,420
The Celestial Court.

173
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,460
After the Deity-Demon War,

174
00:09:20,870 --> 00:09:23,010
the Dragon Clan was granted
the Four Seas.

175
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:25,250
You're the head of the Dragon Clan.

176
00:09:26,150 --> 00:09:28,650
You've kept its place independent
for a thousand years

177
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,890
because the Dragon Clan once pledged

178
00:09:32,670 --> 00:09:33,460
to the Demon Clan.

179
00:09:34,200 --> 00:09:35,250
A thousand years ago,

180
00:09:36,080 --> 00:09:39,060
I was the best fighter
of the Demon Emperor.

181
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:42,490
I still remember

182
00:09:43,240 --> 00:09:46,850
the dread before the Demon Emperor.

183
00:09:48,870 --> 00:09:50,100
So, a thousand years ago,

184
00:09:50,550 --> 00:09:52,060
you turned on the Demon Emperor

185
00:09:52,870 --> 00:09:54,300
and gave the Human Clan a great victory.

186
00:09:56,870 --> 00:09:58,340
You wanted

187
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,730
to let the Dragon Clan be independent

188
00:10:03,390 --> 00:10:04,890
in the world.

189
00:10:06,510 --> 00:10:08,610
So, you want me

190
00:10:10,630 --> 00:10:12,180
to ruin the grand wedding in three days

191
00:10:13,630 --> 00:10:14,850
and drive the Celestial Court

192
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,850
out of the East Sea.

193
00:10:19,910 --> 00:10:20,700
Good.

194
00:10:21,750 --> 00:10:22,650
Very good.

195
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:26,580
Master Jin Chan,

196
00:10:27,080 --> 00:10:28,060
I was right about you

197
00:10:28,870 --> 00:10:30,850
after all.

198
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,650
Your Majesty, we are foes.

199
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,700
Why are you so sure

200
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,580
I'd agree to help you?

201
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:41,180
If the Celestial Court steps
into the East Sea,

202
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:43,820
your sect can't open the Eye of the Sea.

203
00:10:46,120 --> 00:10:49,850
If I agree to fight
the Celestial Court to the death,

204
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:53,010
even if we barely win,

205
00:10:54,030 --> 00:10:55,980
we'd still have the East Sea
as our enemy.

206
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,650
When the Celestial Court comes,

207
00:10:57,870 --> 00:10:59,770
I can simply withdraw first.

208
00:11:01,080 --> 00:11:03,180
Why exhaust myself in a battle here?

209
00:11:06,440 --> 00:11:08,010
I can give you a reason.

210
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,100
This.

211
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:16,650
If you help me drive out
the Celestial Court,

212
00:11:16,670 --> 00:11:19,100
this Sword fragment will be yours.

213
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,220
The Dragon Clan of the Four Seas

214
00:11:24,910 --> 00:11:28,250
all think you've lost
your mind with age.

215
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,940
But in my eyes,

216
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:33,700
you hide the deepest schemes

217
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:36,220
across the Four Seas.

218
00:11:37,910 --> 00:11:38,700
Very well.

219
00:11:39,440 --> 00:11:40,340
In three days,

220
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:42,100
I will return.

221
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,530
You're having second thoughts?

222
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:51,890
No.

223
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,650
You have shown me true sincerity.

224
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,850
I should offer a gift in return.

225
00:12:00,270 --> 00:12:02,460
My Dragon Palace lacks no treasure.

226
00:12:02,480 --> 00:12:03,700
We need no gift from you.

227
00:12:08,910 --> 00:12:10,300
The Chaos Bell.

228
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:16,130
In three days, if you are defeated,

229
00:12:16,270 --> 00:12:18,890
this will be your sole chance
to turn the tide.

230
00:12:19,510 --> 00:12:20,420
Your Majesty,

231
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,610
don't miss this opportunity.

232
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,940
The Chaos Bell.

233
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:37,370
Why hasn't Senior returned yet?

234
00:12:46,630 --> 00:12:47,420
Senior?

235
00:12:48,390 --> 00:12:49,610
Senior, is that you?

236
00:12:49,870 --> 00:12:50,650
I'm here.

237
00:12:55,080 --> 00:12:55,850
Senior?

238
00:12:56,910 --> 00:12:57,700
Senior?

239
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:01,980
Senior?

240
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:08,130
It's not Senior.

241
00:13:10,960 --> 00:13:11,850
What's this? Stop!

242
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:12,700
Quick, catch him!

243
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:14,060
He's escaping! Quick!

244
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:14,770
Get her!

245
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:17,580
If you don't work hard today,

246
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:20,130
the East Sea won't be vibrant tomorrow.

247
00:13:20,600 --> 00:13:22,250
Their lions are not good enough,

248
00:13:22,270 --> 00:13:23,820
because they haven't learned from me.

249
00:13:27,320 --> 00:13:28,220
Make way!

250
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,100
Out of the way!

251
00:13:31,360 --> 00:13:31,820
Go!

252
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:38,530
They're so odd.

253
00:13:43,600 --> 00:13:45,490
They look truly overjoyed.

254
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:46,890
Maybe we

255
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,730
should join them?

256
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:53,060
Tomorrow?

257
00:13:53,790 --> 00:13:54,980
Sure!

258
00:13:58,960 --> 00:13:59,650
What's wrong?

259
00:13:59,670 --> 00:14:01,300
Ascendance disciple Lan Ling'e

260
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:02,980
has been seized by Dragon Palace guards.

261
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,580
The Turtle Minister
invites all honored guests

262
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,940
to the Crystal Palace for a talk.

263
00:14:06,390 --> 00:14:07,180
What did you say?

264
00:14:07,200 --> 00:14:08,370
You took Ling'e!

265
00:14:08,870 --> 00:14:10,220
Bring the prisoner.

266
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:12,180
Senior.

267
00:14:12,550 --> 00:14:13,530
Junior Ling'e.

268
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,340
Kneel!

269
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:16,890
Senior...

270
00:14:17,840 --> 00:14:20,420
You guys are honored guests.

271
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:23,220
We shouldn't have stirred up conflict,

272
00:14:23,510 --> 00:14:27,060
but this one crept
into the palace depths

273
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,300
and shattered a glazed lantern.

274
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,300
I didn't shatter it.

275
00:14:30,320 --> 00:14:31,370
Then who did?

276
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:34,700
And why sneak into the depths?

277
00:14:34,720 --> 00:14:35,980
What are you plotting?

278
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,770
I didn't... I...

279
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:39,580
Senior, what do we do?

280
00:14:40,750 --> 00:14:41,530
Just say the word,

281
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,580
and I'll go save her right now.

282
00:14:42,600 --> 00:14:43,700
Don't rush in just yet.

283
00:14:43,790 --> 00:14:44,580
Let's watch a bit longer.

284
00:14:44,600 --> 00:14:45,250
Wait.

285
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:47,770
Father,

286
00:14:48,200 --> 00:14:50,700
could this be a misunderstanding?

287
00:14:50,870 --> 00:14:52,100
It's just a glazed lantern.

288
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:52,420
Yes, exactly.

289
00:14:52,750 --> 00:14:53,650
How could it come to this?

290
00:14:54,480 --> 00:14:55,610
Yi,

291
00:14:55,910 --> 00:14:58,770
that's my favorite glazed lantern!

292
00:14:59,510 --> 00:15:02,490
She's broken
His Majesty's glazed lantern.

293
00:15:02,510 --> 00:15:04,980
Next, she'll burn the Dragon Throne!

294
00:15:05,000 --> 00:15:05,370
I...

295
00:15:05,390 --> 00:15:06,580
What kind of reasoning is that?

296
00:15:06,790 --> 00:15:07,580
Father.

297
00:15:08,510 --> 00:15:10,610
Ascendance disciples are good people.

298
00:15:10,630 --> 00:15:11,940
They would never damage

299
00:15:11,960 --> 00:15:13,650
anything here.

300
00:15:14,360 --> 00:15:16,010
Please trust me, Father.

301
00:15:16,150 --> 00:15:17,250
Something's off.

302
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:19,890
- How can you trust humans?
- It's indeed fishy.

303
00:15:19,910 --> 00:15:21,530
The Dragon King owns all of Lotus Hall.

304
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:23,580
Why would he care
about one glazed lantern?

305
00:15:24,670 --> 00:15:26,130
Junior is the suspicious one.

306
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:27,060
Who are you talking about?

307
00:15:27,120 --> 00:15:28,370
If you mean no harm,

308
00:15:28,550 --> 00:15:30,370
why sneak deep into the Dragon Palace?

309
00:15:30,390 --> 00:15:31,460
What's your aim?

310
00:15:31,870 --> 00:15:32,580
Good question.

311
00:15:32,600 --> 00:15:34,250
- There's surely something shady.
- Whose side are you on?

312
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,060
Our side.

313
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:37,820
I'm here to catch the villain.

314
00:15:38,720 --> 00:15:39,730
Catch a villain?

315
00:15:40,030 --> 00:15:40,980
I saw someone

316
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,340
sneaking into the Dragon Palace.

317
00:15:42,360 --> 00:15:43,770
Worried for Little Prince's safety,

318
00:15:43,790 --> 00:15:45,060
I followed them in secret.

319
00:15:45,120 --> 00:15:46,010
They're the ones who broke
the glazed lantern.

320
00:15:46,030 --> 00:15:46,940
It has nothing to do with me.

321
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:47,730
Describe it then.

322
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:50,180
What did the figure look like?

323
00:15:50,480 --> 00:15:51,460
I only saw their back,

324
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,490
not their face.

325
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,460
Their back?

326
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:55,370
Even a back shows human or dragon.

327
00:15:55,510 --> 00:15:56,770
Any dragon features?

328
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:04,060
Your Majesty,

329
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,300
they were a human, not a dragon.

330
00:16:10,200 --> 00:16:13,220
We have only one exit.

331
00:16:13,790 --> 00:16:14,580
Turtle Minister,

332
00:16:14,670 --> 00:16:17,580
aside from Yi returning yesterday,

333
00:16:17,600 --> 00:16:18,700
in the past half-month,

334
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:20,580
was the Water Dragon Spout opened?

335
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:22,250
No, Your Majesty. It wasn't.

336
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:24,460
Those entering the East Sea

337
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:26,130
were all brought by the Little Prince.

338
00:16:26,360 --> 00:16:29,980
Last night,
guards combed the Dragon Palace

339
00:16:30,000 --> 00:16:31,130
but found no outsider.

340
00:16:31,150 --> 00:16:32,180
So, it's clear:

341
00:16:32,270 --> 00:16:34,820
This woman keeps spouting nonsense.

342
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,490
Your Majesty, everything I said is true.

343
00:16:36,510 --> 00:16:38,010
Please believe me, Your Majesty.

344
00:16:43,200 --> 00:16:44,220
Turtle Minister,

345
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,700
lock her up in the dungeon first.

346
00:16:45,720 --> 00:16:46,300
Father.

347
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,370
Enough, Yi.

348
00:16:47,390 --> 00:16:49,010
Tomorrow is your grand wedding.

349
00:16:49,030 --> 00:16:51,300
Why let her ruin it?

350
00:16:51,320 --> 00:16:53,490
Turtle Minister,
take her to the dungeon.

351
00:16:53,510 --> 00:16:55,940
I'll deal with this
after the grand wedding.

352
00:16:56,120 --> 00:16:56,730
Aunt.

353
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,010
Don't be impulsive.

354
00:16:58,080 --> 00:16:59,580
If we don't save her now,
she's done for.

355
00:17:00,390 --> 00:17:01,180
No, no.

356
00:17:01,320 --> 00:17:01,980
Senior, Aunt.

357
00:17:02,000 --> 00:17:02,420
Junior.

358
00:17:02,750 --> 00:17:03,420
Junior.

359
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:04,490
Senior.

360
00:17:07,880 --> 00:17:08,860
Improve yourself.

361
00:17:09,350 --> 00:17:10,330
Turn over a new leaf.

362
00:17:10,350 --> 00:17:11,380
Get tortured.

363
00:17:12,270 --> 00:17:12,730
Junior.

364
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:13,250
Ling'e.

365
00:17:13,270 --> 00:17:13,770
Junior.

366
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:27,330
No.

367
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:28,980
I must see the Dragon King

368
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:29,980
to rescue Ling'e.

369
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:30,620
Aunt.

370
00:17:30,640 --> 00:17:31,490
Aunt, you mustn't!

371
00:17:31,510 --> 00:17:32,940
What are we waiting for?

372
00:17:33,070 --> 00:17:33,980
We came here

373
00:17:34,030 --> 00:17:35,940
to foil the Westdawn Sect's plot.

374
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:37,810
If we fight the Dragon Palace now,

375
00:17:37,830 --> 00:17:39,700
we'd give Westdawn an opening.

376
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:40,660
I know, but Ling'e...

377
00:17:40,680 --> 00:17:41,420
Aunt.

378
00:17:42,000 --> 00:17:43,490
If Uncle Jiu Wu were here,

379
00:17:43,750 --> 00:17:44,700
what would he do?

380
00:18:01,400 --> 00:18:02,180
Changshou,

381
00:18:02,920 --> 00:18:04,010
you're the cleverest.

382
00:18:05,240 --> 00:18:06,570
What should we do then?

383
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:08,180
I'll follow your lead.

384
00:18:09,590 --> 00:18:10,490
Junior said

385
00:18:11,510 --> 00:18:13,570
she saw a mysterious figure.

386
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:17,290
A mysterious person broke
the glazed lantern.

387
00:18:17,400 --> 00:18:19,250
Junior Ling'e may be quirky,

388
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:21,250
but she's not one to make things up.

389
00:18:21,270 --> 00:18:23,380
I believe she saw someone.

390
00:18:23,400 --> 00:18:24,490
I believe her too.

391
00:18:25,030 --> 00:18:27,770
But everyone says no one else was there.

392
00:18:28,350 --> 00:18:31,330
The point isn't whether it's true

393
00:18:31,720 --> 00:18:34,530
but how to make everyone believe

394
00:18:34,550 --> 00:18:36,460
that this mystery person exists.

395
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:38,570
If we don't find this mystery person,

396
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,860
then we can

397
00:18:40,400 --> 00:18:42,090
create a mysterious figure

398
00:18:42,830 --> 00:18:44,940
so we can show everyone
that in the Dragon Palace,

399
00:18:44,960 --> 00:18:46,980
such a person really exists.

400
00:18:49,070 --> 00:18:49,860
Wouldn't that solve it?

401
00:19:00,510 --> 00:19:01,220
Senior,

402
00:19:01,790 --> 00:19:03,490
our Skyrend's magic arts

403
00:19:03,960 --> 00:19:05,770
are all righteous divine abilities.

404
00:19:06,590 --> 00:19:08,770
You want me to pose
as a mystery man to assassinate?

405
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,490
I...

406
00:19:10,400 --> 00:19:11,660
I have no confidence.

407
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,050
Junior Xuanya,

408
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:15,730
I understand all your concerns.

409
00:19:16,030 --> 00:19:18,010
After all, under normal circumstances,

410
00:19:18,030 --> 00:19:21,090
this work is usually done
by Junior Ling'e.

411
00:19:21,110 --> 00:19:22,570
But she's not here right now,

412
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:26,570
so I can only pick you

413
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:29,250
or Aunt Jiu Jiu.

414
00:19:34,750 --> 00:19:36,140
It can only be you.

415
00:19:36,160 --> 00:19:37,700
You're the only one for this job.

416
00:19:37,790 --> 00:19:38,660
No one else can do it.

417
00:19:40,070 --> 00:19:41,420
To save Junior Ling'e,

418
00:19:41,440 --> 00:19:42,860
we must make the Dragon Clan believe

419
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,290
there's a mysterious person
in the Dragon Palace.

420
00:19:44,510 --> 00:19:45,490
You pick a target.

421
00:19:45,790 --> 00:19:47,900
Just make a failed attempt.

422
00:19:48,030 --> 00:19:48,810
Go for it.

423
00:19:49,750 --> 00:19:51,810
But the Dragon Palace
is heavily guarded.

424
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:53,380
Guards patrol closely.

425
00:19:53,400 --> 00:19:53,810
I...

426
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,380
I can't sneak in.

427
00:19:56,640 --> 00:19:57,770
Leave that to me.

428
00:20:45,590 --> 00:20:47,220
Lost and found!

429
00:20:47,680 --> 00:20:48,700
Let me see.

430
00:20:49,790 --> 00:20:50,570
You...

431
00:20:51,590 --> 00:20:53,290
You'll get it when I'm done.

432
00:20:54,110 --> 00:20:55,490
Hurry up then.

433
00:20:56,750 --> 00:20:57,530
Success.

434
00:20:59,270 --> 00:21:00,180
What success?

435
00:21:00,480 --> 00:21:02,460
You little rascal, what's your scheme?

436
00:21:02,480 --> 00:21:03,380
Do you still need me?

437
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,980
Aunt.

438
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:07,220
You'll be very useful later.

439
00:21:08,920 --> 00:21:09,770
Let me out!

440
00:21:09,790 --> 00:21:11,570
You thick-headed, blind dragons!

441
00:21:11,590 --> 00:21:13,180
We're here to rescue you.

442
00:21:13,200 --> 00:21:14,380
Why lock me up here?

443
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:16,330
Anyone there? Let me out!

444
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:21,770
Senior.

445
00:21:22,400 --> 00:21:24,290
When will you come save me?

446
00:21:24,750 --> 00:21:26,570
Make sure she improves herself

447
00:21:27,200 --> 00:21:28,380
and turns over a new leaf.

448
00:21:30,110 --> 00:21:31,180
Torture her!

449
00:21:33,440 --> 00:21:36,090
Stupid Senior! Wicked Senior!

450
00:21:36,110 --> 00:21:37,570
Scoundrel Senior.

451
00:21:41,400 --> 00:21:42,140
Young lady,

452
00:21:42,480 --> 00:21:43,620
who are you calling Senior?

453
00:21:45,350 --> 00:21:46,570
I'm not your Senior.

454
00:21:47,310 --> 00:21:49,380
Are you tired of shouting?

455
00:21:49,750 --> 00:21:51,660
If so, come with me.

456
00:21:52,000 --> 00:21:53,980
I thought the execution was
after the wedding.

457
00:21:54,030 --> 00:21:55,180
Don't be so hasty.

458
00:21:55,200 --> 00:21:56,250
I'm still young.

459
00:21:58,790 --> 00:21:59,570
So young.

460
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,620
Assassinating at the Dragon Palace

461
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:06,290
is surprisingly hard.

462
00:22:07,000 --> 00:22:08,900
This must be a trial from Senior.

463
00:22:09,070 --> 00:22:10,420
I won't disappoint him.

464
00:22:13,270 --> 00:22:14,860
I'm still young and beautiful.

465
00:22:15,000 --> 00:22:16,490
I'm still in the bloom of youth.

466
00:22:16,790 --> 00:22:18,770
I've never been in love!

467
00:22:18,790 --> 00:22:19,810
Turtle Minister.

468
00:22:20,790 --> 00:22:22,180
That is indeed a pity.

469
00:22:22,350 --> 00:22:24,420
Listen. Love is really fun.

470
00:22:25,480 --> 00:22:26,250
Well.

471
00:22:27,400 --> 00:22:29,570
You two, step outside.

472
00:22:29,590 --> 00:22:30,980
Guard the door.

473
00:22:31,400 --> 00:22:32,180
Yes.

474
00:22:33,200 --> 00:22:33,980
No.

475
00:22:34,440 --> 00:22:35,140
What's that supposed to mean?

476
00:22:35,160 --> 00:22:35,770
Please.

477
00:22:47,830 --> 00:22:50,570
I'll be killed after I've had my fill?

478
00:22:50,590 --> 00:22:52,860
Right, it's like a buffet.

479
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:54,180
Got it.

480
00:22:54,200 --> 00:22:55,420
Then I won't hold back.

481
00:23:09,070 --> 00:23:09,860
Shh.

482
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:25,770
Is it good?

483
00:23:27,550 --> 00:23:28,490
Your Majesty, Your Majesty.

484
00:23:28,510 --> 00:23:30,050
Miss, don't be afraid.

485
00:23:30,200 --> 00:23:32,570
I prepared these for you.

486
00:23:32,590 --> 00:23:34,700
Eat and drink to your heart's content.

487
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:36,490
Really?

488
00:23:37,920 --> 00:23:38,730
Then I'll dig in.

489
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:52,050
What are you doing?

490
00:23:54,350 --> 00:23:55,180
Your Majesty, well.

491
00:23:55,200 --> 00:23:56,050
Don't come any closer.

492
00:23:56,070 --> 00:23:57,220
I only had a few bites of your food.

493
00:23:57,240 --> 00:23:58,290
I can spit it out.

494
00:23:58,310 --> 00:23:59,770
And you just told me to eat it.

495
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:01,330
Don't come closer!

496
00:24:01,440 --> 00:24:02,570
Help!

497
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:10,980
What the hell is this?

498
00:24:11,590 --> 00:24:13,140
It's indeed the Chaos Bell!

499
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:24,810
Where did you get this?

500
00:24:25,270 --> 00:24:26,700
It's a keepsake from my mother.

501
00:24:27,590 --> 00:24:28,010
You...

502
00:24:28,920 --> 00:24:30,090
Who are you?

503
00:24:32,200 --> 00:24:33,290
I'm Lan Ling'e,

504
00:24:33,400 --> 00:24:35,090
a disciple of Jade Division,
Ascendance Sect.

505
00:24:35,200 --> 00:24:36,860
Lan Ling'e.

506
00:24:42,750 --> 00:24:43,460
What are you laughing at?

507
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:44,530
That's the truth.

508
00:24:44,550 --> 00:24:47,010
Miss, you seem unaware

509
00:24:47,030 --> 00:24:48,860
of your true identity.

510
00:24:48,880 --> 00:24:51,050
How could a mere Ascendance disciple

511
00:24:51,350 --> 00:24:53,140
wear the Chaos Bell?

512
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:58,570
My true identity?

513
00:24:59,750 --> 00:25:01,530
Do you not know your origins?

514
00:25:23,240 --> 00:25:24,180
You're also

515
00:25:25,030 --> 00:25:26,330
here for the assassination?

516
00:25:27,790 --> 00:25:28,810
You too?

517
00:25:33,270 --> 00:25:34,050
Assassination?

518
00:25:35,200 --> 00:25:35,980
Exactly.

519
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:39,380
I hid you in the East Sea
for half a month

520
00:25:40,070 --> 00:25:41,570
for this very plan.

521
00:25:43,070 --> 00:25:44,980
Changgeng's whole setup in the East Sea

522
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,810
revolves around Ao Yi.

523
00:25:48,110 --> 00:25:50,050
If we can eliminate Ao Yi,

524
00:25:50,920 --> 00:25:54,290
Changgeng will have no moves left.

525
00:25:56,000 --> 00:25:57,570
Changgeng.

526
00:25:58,590 --> 00:25:59,380
Relax.

527
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,010
Leave this to me.

528
00:26:02,110 --> 00:26:03,050
Remember:

529
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:05,180
Act in secret.

530
00:26:06,200 --> 00:26:07,980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

531
00:26:08,030 --> 00:26:09,700
know we're behind this.

532
00:26:10,790 --> 00:26:11,770
Better yet,

533
00:26:12,240 --> 00:26:14,620
frame the Ascendance Sect.

534
00:26:17,160 --> 00:26:18,050
How do I pull that off?

535
00:26:24,200 --> 00:26:25,460
I have a plan.

536
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:29,050
You just do your best.

537
00:26:35,240 --> 00:26:37,180
I knew he had a plan.

538
00:26:37,200 --> 00:26:37,860
I knew

539
00:26:37,880 --> 00:26:39,620
he wouldn't have me attempt this alone.

540
00:26:41,680 --> 00:26:42,730
He?

541
00:26:44,480 --> 00:26:47,940
Did Senior send you to meet me?

542
00:26:48,640 --> 00:26:49,420
Senior?

543
00:26:52,590 --> 00:26:54,140
You call him Senior?

544
00:26:55,000 --> 00:26:56,180
So, you're a fellow cultivator.

545
00:26:56,440 --> 00:26:57,530
My apologies. My apologies.

546
00:26:59,310 --> 00:27:00,660
Since we're fellow cultivators,

547
00:27:00,830 --> 00:27:02,090
there's no need for such formality.

548
00:27:02,880 --> 00:27:03,660
But

549
00:27:04,110 --> 00:27:06,530
how come I've never seen you before?

550
00:27:08,200 --> 00:27:08,980
Your Senior

551
00:27:10,270 --> 00:27:12,220
hid me in the East Sea half a month ago.

552
00:27:12,240 --> 00:27:13,570
He told me to stay out of sight

553
00:27:13,590 --> 00:27:14,810
and keep to the shadows.

554
00:27:14,830 --> 00:27:16,180
That's why none of you have seen me.

555
00:27:18,400 --> 00:27:21,770
So, Senior had this planned all along.

556
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:24,940
Truly far-sighted. Impressive.

557
00:27:26,880 --> 00:27:28,980
Don't let the Dragon Clan

558
00:27:29,270 --> 00:27:30,570
know we're behind this.

559
00:27:31,590 --> 00:27:32,380
Better yet,

560
00:27:33,440 --> 00:27:35,570
frame the Ascendance Sect.

561
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,530
Brilliant!

562
00:27:40,640 --> 00:27:42,010
I never imagined your disguise

563
00:27:42,030 --> 00:27:43,460
could be so masterful.

564
00:27:43,750 --> 00:27:46,010
It's seamless, absolutely lifelike.

565
00:27:46,030 --> 00:27:47,730
I can't find a single flaw.

566
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,380
This is but an ordinary disguise.

567
00:27:52,400 --> 00:27:53,490
Ordinary?

568
00:27:57,590 --> 00:27:58,380
Listen.

569
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,940
With this disguise, the assassination

570
00:28:01,160 --> 00:28:03,140
will surely mislead the Dragon Palace.

571
00:28:05,000 --> 00:28:06,180
As Senior said,

572
00:28:06,720 --> 00:28:09,380
I want the Dragon Palace
to mistake me for the assassin.

